#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[[!tag announce]]\n"
msgstr "[[!tag announce]]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"We replaced *balenaEtcher* with *Rufus* in our [[installation instructions "
"for Windows|install/windows]] to solve privacy concerns with *balenaEtcher*."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons remplacé *balenaEtcher* par *Rufus* dans nos [[instructions "
"d'installation pour Windows|install/windows]] pour résoudre les problèmes de "
"protection de la vie privée avec *balenaEtcher*."

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Since [[January 2019|report_2019_01]], we had been recommending "
"[*balenaEtcher*](https://etcher.balena.io/) to install Tails from Windows "
"and macOS. We loved the simplicity of *balenaEtcher*, which was really "
"easier to use and worked on macOS as well."
msgstr ""
"Depuis [[janvier 2019|report_2019_01]], nous recommandions "
"[*balenaEtcher*](https://etcher.balena.io/) pour installer Tails depuis "
"Windows et macOS. Nous aimions la simplicité de *balenaEtcher*, qui était "
"vraiment plus facile à utiliser et fonctionnait également sur macOS."

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Shortly after, *balenaEtcher* started displaying ads. Although we didn't "
"like that, we initially didn't view it as a significant privacy risk and had "
"no better alternative at the time."
msgstr ""
"Peu après, *balenaEtcher* a commencé à afficher des publicités. Bien que "
"nous n'aimions pas cela, nous ne considérions pas initialement qu'il "
"s'agissait d'un risque important pour la vie privée et nous n'avions pas de "
"meilleure alternative à l'époque."

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"However, in 2024, the situation changed: *balenaEtcher* started sharing the "
"file name of the image and the model of the USB stick with the Balena "
"company and possibly with third parties. While we have not experienced or "
"heard of any attacks against Tails users stemming from this change, we "
"believe it introduces potential for abuse. To eliminate that risk "
"altogether, we started looking again for alternatives."
msgstr ""
"Cependant, en 2024, la situation a changé : *balenaEtcher* a commencé à "
"partager le nom de fichier de l'image et le modèle de la clé USB avec "
"l'entreprise Balena et peut-être avec des tiers. Bien que nous n'ayons pas "
"rencontré ou entendu parler d'attaques contre des personnes utilisant Tails "
"découlant de ce changement, nous pensons qu'il introduit un risque d'abus. "
"Pour éliminer complètement ce risque, nous avons recommencé à chercher des "
"alternatives."

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After evaluating [[!tails_ticket 20423 desc=\"7 other tools\"]], we finally "
"chose\n"
"[*Rufus*](https://rufus.ie/). We had [[!tails_ticket 7034 desc=\"tested "
"*Rufus*\n"
"many years ago\"]], even before recommending *balenaEtcher*, but it was "
"much\n"
"harder to use and modified the Tails image in ways that were risky.\n"
msgstr ""
"Après avoir évalué [[!tails_ticket 20423 desc=\"7 autres outils\"]], nous "
"avons finalement choisi\n"
"[*Rufus*](https://rufus.ie/). Nous avions [[!tails_ticket 7034 desc=\"testé "
"*Rufus*\n"
"il y a plusieurs années\"]], avant même de recommander *balenaEtcher*, mais "
"il était beaucoup\n"
"plus difficile à utiliser et il modifiait l'image de Tails d'une manière "
"risquée.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Congratulations to Akeo Consulting, the company behind *Rufus*, for really "
"improving the usability and reliability of their tool!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"We have not yet replaced *balenaEtcher* in our installation instructions for "
"macOS because *Rufus* doesn't work on macOS. Also, as Tails doesn't work on "
"Apple M1 and M2 processors, people who install Tails from macOS represent "
"less than 10% of installations nowadays."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Still, we recommend [[2 alternatives for macOS|/install/mac#etcher]]: "
"installing Tails using `dd` on the command line or using [*Raspberry Pi "
"Imager*](https://www.raspberrypi.com/software/)."
msgstr ""
"Toutefois, nous recommandons [[2 alternatives pour macOS|/install/"
"mac#etcher]] : installer Tails en utilisant `dd` en ligne de commande ou en "
"utilisant [*Raspberry Pi Imager*](https://www.raspberrypi.com/software/)."
